","id":2532500920,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6W8uW4","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-10T18:09:39Z","updated_at":"2024-12-10T18:09:39Z","body":"> This is _not_ a codestyle change, just to be clear, this is performance improvements theoretically\r\n\r\nIMO this should be considered a codestyle improvement before being regarded as a performance optimization. It's a best practice stuff. Not every `reserve` result in considerable performance gain, but by enforcing this style, we can avoid accidentally writing poorly performing code.\r\n\r\nShould probably mention this in code standard, remind everyone to do this.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532500920/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532503487","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100251#issuecomment-2